WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.540
Somewhere in this world, there is 
a door that leads to my dreams.

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.310
I don't know where that door is.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.840
I may not find it in my entire life.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.980
And even if I do find it, 
it may be locked to me...

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.030
Good morning, Lala-Lulu.

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:58.290
You're as adorable as ever today!

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:31.830
What? Still no jobs?

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:32.970
But why?

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:35.130
Because you turned down that 
last offer, Nagisa-san.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:38.800
But I didn't want to co-star 
with <i>him</i> again!

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:38.800
<i>My name is Sena Izumi.</i>

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.320
Then who do you want to co-star with?

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:41.320
<i>I just started college this spring.</i>

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.550
Umm... What was his name again?

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:43.550
Good morning.

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:45.430
Good morni— Oh!

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.430
<b><i>The Door to My Dreams</i></b>

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.560
<i>I'll keep racing forward...</i>

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:50.800
<i>...with this car.</i>

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.160
Him! Him!

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.720
<i>The all-new Tomita Grazie.</i>

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.720
Isn't he just gorgeous?

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.900
Ah, he's everywhere these days, isn't he?

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.900
<i>Coming soon to a Tomita dealership near you.</i>

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.370
He's got a good feel to him.

00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:01.410
Exactly! He used to have that 
"cute" thing going for him.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.410
Wait, you mean Ichijou Ryouma?!

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.200
Can't you at least remember the name of

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:05.160
But lately, he's become so manly. 
It works so well on him!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.160
the hottest young rising star 
in the country?!

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:08.430
I want to co-star in something with him!

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:10.470
I'm sure Rei can arrange something.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:13.250
Please don't ask the impossible, Mr. President!

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:16.410
Ichijou Ryouma must be booked solid!

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.210
<i>This is my mother, Sena Nagisa.</i>

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.860
<i>She started off as model</i>

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:24.760
<i>and is now a major actress 
in both films and TV dramas.</i>

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:27.500
<i>This is my father, Sena Seiya.</i>

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.750
<i>He's a singer who starred in musicals,</i>

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.890
<i>and now owns the talent agency Sena-Pro.</i>

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.170
<i>Finally, this is their 
extremely capable manager,</i>

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:37.560
<i>who supports them both at 
home and at Sena-Pro,</i>

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:39.150
<i>Sagara Rei.</i>

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:43.200
<b>Show Biz Family</b>

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.860
We, the Senas, are a show biz family.

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:46.260
My brother Shougo, who's 
seven years older than me,

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:47.440
is the vocalist of a rock band.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:50.480
My grandparents were 
an actor and a dancer.

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:53.320
By the way, Izumi...

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:56.610
Have you been seeing that vocal coach?

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.350
Shani-san's agreed to give 
you dance lessons, as well.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.160
You're already 18 years old, so you need to—

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:05.870
Wow, just look at the time!

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.780
I'd better get going! Have a nice day!

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.840
Hey! Wait a moment!

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:13.800
Oh, honestly. What's he going 
to do with his future?

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.550
He's acting like an otaku, too...

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:17.690
He isn't acting. He <i>is</i> an otaku.

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:21.640
<i>Yep, we're a family of entertainers, all right.</i>

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.410
<b>Sena Productions</b>

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.410
Sena

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.410
<i>Apart from me, that is.</i>

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:29.710
<i>My family keeps pushing 
me toward show business,</i>

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.340
<i>but I know what I can and can't do.</i>

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:33.570
In his seminal work <i>Being and Time,</i>
 Heidegger states,

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:35.010
<i>I could never perform in front of people.</i>

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:38.450
"If a man does not acknowledge the 
irrevocable fact that he will one day die,

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:36.420
<i>I'm horrible at that stuff.</i>

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.470
<i>And I have my own dreams, too.</i>

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:43.910
he can never truly experience 
what it is to live."

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:45.340
<b>Lala-Lulu
Saotome Miyabi</b>

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:43.430
<i>I want to become a manga artist, 
like Saotome Miyabi,</i>

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:45.020
<i>the author of "Lala-Lulu!"</i>

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:48.050
<i>You're very talented.</i>

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.270
<b>Poink</b>

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:52.270
<i>Something seems off...</i>

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.840
<i>I've practiced drawing enough 
now, so I'll try drawing</i>

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.640
<i>a storyboard to submit to a magazine!</i>

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.940
<b>Manga Research Club</b>

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:01.310
Hey, guys.

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:02.210
Sena.

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.450
We've got the new issue of <i>Young Zeta.</i>

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.200
Really?!

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:19.670
<i>I ended up just reading manga again today.</i>

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:25.530
<i>But I guess I don't really know how 
to make a manga storyboard anyway...</i>

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:33.070
<i>Oh, well. I'll just try again tomorrow.</i>

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:33.820
I'm home...

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:35.660
Welcome home, Izumi-san.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.260
We've been waiting for you!

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:38.270
You're late today.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:50.120
<i>Have a wonderful wedding at any age.</i>

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.840
<i>"Happy Wedding," a new magazine.</i>

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:56.750
This is...

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:01.460
Ten years ago, the three of 
you starred in this commercial

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.300
for the bridal magazine <i>Happy Wedding.</i>

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:06.710
Izumi was so cute! Seiya-kun was so young!

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:08.340
You haven't changed a bit, darling.

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:11.140
To commemorate their 10th anniversary,

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:15.400
<i>Happy Wedding</i> wants 
to film another commercial.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.510
The concept is:

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:18.720
"A Wedding Ten Years Later."

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:21.450
It will show the children 
who caught the bouquet,

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:23.580
now getting married 
themselves ten years later.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.700
They want to keep the 
same casting as before,

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:29.070
so this offer is for all of you.

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:29.780
Huh?

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:32.090
I'll do it, I'll do it! It sounds like fun!

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.540
If you want to do it, I'll do it, too, honey.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:36.540
W-Wait a second!

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.230
By "all of you," do you mean me, too?!

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:38.960
Of course.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:40.830
No, no, no, no, no!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.370
There's no way I can do this!

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:45.360
Can't they just use a girl 
who looks like me instead?

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:47.690
There's a problem with that.

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:48.630
Problem?

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:49.980
The thing is,

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:51.750
we've learned that the role 
of the boy was played by

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.010
none other than the wildly 
popular Ichijou Ryouma.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.140
What?!

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:57.350
<i>I keep racing forward...</i>

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.480
<i>Happy Wedding</i> is overjoyed!

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.480
*Just a Mental image

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.480
<b>Wedding                  Happy</b>

00:06:58.620 --> 00:06:59.480
Hurray!

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.080
Nagisa-san is also overjoyed!

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.690
Yay! Yay!

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.400
And the one condition Ichijou 
Ryouma put forth for

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.660
his involvement in the commercial

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.960
is that it has to have the exact 
same cast as ten years ago.

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:13.660
B-But, you could still use someone else

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:14.990
and he'd never know!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.250
He specifically mentioned that 
he remembered the girl's

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.380
strikingly unique eye color...

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:25.130
Those being the circumstances, 
please appear in the commercial.

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:25.130
Yay! Co-starring with Ryouma!

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.340
Hold on a second!

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.340
<b>STOP</b>

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.340
Bicycles must also stop.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:29.830
Aren't you all forgetting one vital little fact?

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:31.300
What vital little fact?

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.130
I'm a guy!

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:38.020
I might've passed for a girl 
ten years ago, but now...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.250
No problem.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:45.900
With your short stature and skinny frame, 
you'll absolutely pass for a girl!

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.230
Shut up!

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.330
I've had it! I'm not doing this commercial!

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.450
Please wait.

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:53.230
This commercial is an excellent start 
for your entertainment caree—

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:54.780
Like I've said...

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.950
I am <i>not</i> going into entertainment! 
I don't want to!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.660
Then what do you plan to do with your future?

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:01.520
Huh?

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:04.040
You went to college without 
any particular goals,

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.670
and you're an anti-social 
otaku with zero people skills.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.420
As you are, you could never 
get a job in the real world!

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:11.760
I-I'm going to become a manga artist...

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.880
A manga artist?!

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.490
What chance do you think you have 
with those crappy drawings

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:17.730
that look like they were drawn by a drunk,

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:19.220
in the dark, with his left hand?! 
Life's not that easy!!

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:20.630
Uh...

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:23.910
Rei, you stupid, horrible jerk!

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:25.830
I'll never be in your stupid commercial!

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:27.290
Damn it...

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:30.250
Huh? Then what about Ryouma?

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:31.280
It's not happening, is it?

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:31.280
Nope.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.350
No! No! No!

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:36.240
I want to co-star with Ryouma!

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.240
Don't cry, Nagisa.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:39.120
Rei-kun will fix this for us.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.650
No!

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:39.660
Huh?

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:41.660
Right?

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:47.170
<i>That was cruel! So cruel!</i>

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.550
<i>How could you be that cruel, Rei?!</i>

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:53.110
<i>Why can't anyone understand me?!</i>

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:59.260
<i>Somewhere in this world, 
there's a door that leads to my dreams.</i>

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.380
<i>I've been searching</i>

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:05.490
<i>for the door to the manga 
world, but I can't find it.</i>

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.410
<i>Meanwhile, the door to show business, 
which I totally don't want,</i>

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.970
<i>is standing wide open.</i>

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.530
<i>But...</i>

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.490
The actress playing the girl can't make it?

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:22.430
Her flight got canceled, 
so she won't arrive in time.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:23.120
Got a back-up?

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:26.110
There aren't any girls of the 
right age among the extras.

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:28.500
The manager's found a good replacement,

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.880
but it'll take her three hours to get here.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.340
The sunlight will be all wrong by then!

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:38.410
They're asking if you could just 
change the plot of the commercial...

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:39.870
Easy for them to say.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.310
Director!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.560
Could you use my kid?

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.520
Though he's not a girl.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:45.220
<b>10 minutes later</b>

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:50.440
He's adorable! Suga-chan, good job!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.970
He was already a cutie!

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:53.360
All right! Let's roll with this!

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.940
The actor for the boy is here!

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:56.950
Good morning!

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:59.960
Are you my co-star today? Nice to meet you.

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:03.620
Um...

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.920
Continuing on! Let's do another take!

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:13.570
Are you okay?

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.550
Places, please, everyone!

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.010
Someone get a towel!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.260
Is the costume okay?!

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:21.040
<i>I never want to feel that way again!</i>

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:23.740
<i>I'll never go into entertainment!</i>

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:27.480
<i>I've always preferred 
playing by myself, anyway.</i>

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:29.270
<i>And...</i>

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.880
You're very talented.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:34.390
Your coloring is especially good.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:39.770
<b>Lala-Lulu</b>

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:39.770
<b>I'll give my heart to you, Lulu!</b>

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:39.290
<i>I already know that I want 
to be a manga artist...</i>

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:42.740
<i>Your coloring is especially good.</i>

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:45.160
<i>Your coloring is especially...</i>

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.000
<i>Your coloring...</i>

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.060
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:49.750
<i>Wait a sec...</i>

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.070
<i>If the coloring was the best part...</i>

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:59.840
<i>Saotome-sensei said the more you draw, 
the better you become!</i>

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.200
<i>So, I just need to draw a lot!</i>

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:01.800
<i>See?</i>

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:05.970
<b>Poink</b>

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:05.970
<i>Something really does look off...</i>

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:08.480
<b>Lala-Lulu</b>

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:12.100
<i>I joined the Manga Research Club to 
learn how to draw manga, but...</i>

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:18.600
<i>Oh, Lala-Lulu... where is the 
door that leads to your world?</i>

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:21.420
Huh?

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:22.990
Huh?!

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:30.160
Hmm, let's see...

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:32.370
Wh-Who are you?

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:36.500
Wait a—

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:37.420
Why's he here?!

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:38.760
Ah-hah!

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:43.050
Izumi! I found you!

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:45.620
Who's that?

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:47.390
Isn't that Shougo?

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.000
No way!

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.110
It really looks like him!

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:50.140
Is that really him?!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.300
This way!

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:55.020
What were you thinking?!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.270
What did you come here for, Onii-chan?!

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:58.910
I came to see you, Izumi!

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:00.690
Why couldn't you just wait at the house?!

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.300
<i>This is Sena Shougo.</i>

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:05.410
<i>Vocalist of the rock band 
CRUSHERZ, and my brother,</i>

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:07.450
<i>who is seven years older than me.</i>

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.770
I'm supposed to be working right now,

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:11.410
so this is the only time I could sneak out!

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:13.620
Then I had to look all 
over the school for you!

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.670
Why'd you have to pull a stunt like this?!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.530
Without even wearing a disguise!

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:19.300
I was disguised! Sunglasses!

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:21.330
Though, no one was fooled.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:24.540
I guess your big bro just has too 
much... what would you call it?

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:25.680
Aura?

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:28.720
I just can't keep it all in!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:29.680
<b>IRRITATION</b>

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:31.640
But anyway.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:32.700
Listen, Izumi...

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:33.850
I refuse!

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:36.060
But I haven't said anything yet!

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:38.260
Rei asked you to come here, didn't he?

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:40.230
Guess the jig is up.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:43.330
We must have Izumi participate in this.

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:44.200
Got it!

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.180
That makes things easy.

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:47.830
You should do that commercial.

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:52.940
You're so darn cute, Izumi, you 
should totally be on TV and stuff!

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:54.680
You only think that because 
you're my brother.

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:57.790
Plus, if you do the commercial,

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:01.260
I'll give you this 
super-special alarm clock!

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:03.710
<b>Huh?</b>

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:03.720
Huh?

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:06.590
You think you can bribe me 
with a thing like that?

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:07.420
Are you making fun of—

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:10.280
Now, now. Just see what happens 
when I press this button.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.830
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:16.150
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:20.670
Lala-Lulu! Lala-Lulu is calling me!

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:21.690
I asked the voice actress to record 
this special wake-up recording for you!

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:23.080
So if you want this...

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:23.550
I'll do it!

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:24.280
Huh?

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:27.790
If I stop and think about it, 
dressing up as a girl in a wedding dress

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.200
is kind of like cosplay!

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:32.660
And I've always wanted to try cosplaying!

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:35.170
I see, I see! Good boy.

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.530
Then, here you go.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.920
Yay! Thank you, Onii-chan!

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.210
You sure love Lala-Lulu, Izumi!

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:42.570
<i>I'll be fine doing it just this once.</i>

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.570
Between Lala-Lulu and me, 
whom do you love more?

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:44.380
Me, of course! Right?

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:44.380
<i>After all, it's for Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:49.430
Please don't push! That's dangerous!

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:50.720
Stay back!

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:51.010
Ryouma!

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:54.350
Please stay back. Please, 
that's dangerous! Stay back!

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.430
I'm so tired.

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:57.410
I'm gonna take a nap.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:58.030
Sure thing.

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:02.150
Oh! By the way, we got a 
greenlight on that commercial!

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.480
What commercial?

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:06.600
The <i>Happy Wedding</i> 
10th Anniversary commercial.

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:07.780
Really?!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:08.490
Yes.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:11.030
I see...

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:18.270
Oh? You certainly look happy!

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:18.670
Huh?

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:20.660
When you gave them that condition,

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:23.000
I thought it meant you 
weren't very keen on it.

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:26.580
If I'm not keen on something, 
I just refuse it outright, don't I?

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:27.650
You certainly do.

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:30.490
You're so clear, one could 
say you lack some delicacy.

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:33.640
Coming from you, Shino-san?

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.160
What's that supposed to mean?

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:36.600
Exactly what it means.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:40.270
Good morning.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.070
Good morning!

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:43.040
Good morning.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.380
Seiya-san!

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.160
It's rare to see you here. 
Did something happen?

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:53.120
I've had Satou-san print out the 
script for that commercial.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.550
I got it sent via e-mail this morning.

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:57.980
Because the president said he'd like 
to see it as soon as possible.

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:00.120
Thanks for doing that.

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.830
There are four parts in total.

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:04.690
Thank you.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:07.400
I really hope this will be a good chance.

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:10.570
For my son, I mean.

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:13.670
Yes.

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:16.280
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:19.350
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.560
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.400
Good morning, Lala-Lulu.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.520
All right! I'll work hard today!

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:30.830
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:34.270
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.440
Good morning, Lala-Lulu.

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:37.540
I'll do my best!

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:42.620
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.740
<i>Go out there and do your best today!</i>

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:48.300
Good morning, Lala-Lulu. I'll do my best...

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.390
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:57.820
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:59.890
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.760
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.150
Good morning, Lala-Lulu.

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.500
I'm not sure I can do my best today...

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:14.320
Ryouma! Ryouma! Today I meet Ryouma!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:16.790
You look absolutely stunning today, Nagisa.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:21.140
Really? I used a super-duper 
expensive facial mask last night!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:22.900
I know.

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:24.630
Everyone, we should get going soon.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:28.610
Izumi-san, you need to eat properly today!

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:30.800
It won't do to lose energy during filming!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:31.800
I can't!

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:32.890
If I eat now, I'll throw up!

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:34.400
Though if I don't eat now, I'll also throw up.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:36.480
If I get in a car, I'll definitely throw up!

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:38.700
I feel super-duper sick.

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:40.180
Don't you worry, now.

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:42.690
We have plenty of barf bags.

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:44.340
Now, off we go!

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:46.440
No! My stomach really hurts!

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.010
Daddy will rub your back for you.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:49.840
<i>This is for your own sake, Izumi-san...</i>

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.570
Good morning!

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:56.490
I'm Miho! I'll do your make-up and hair!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.190
I'm Shiho! I'll do your nails!

00:16:58.190 --> 00:16:59.830
And I'm Maho! I'll do your wardrobe!

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:04.540
These three are the trusted backstage 
staff who work with Shougo.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.630
You can relax and entrust yourself to them.

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:09.230
Oh! Once you take his 
glasses off, he's adorable!

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:11.240
His eye color is just like Shougo's!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:12.740
His skin is so perky!

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:14.500
His hair is so silky!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.560
Shoulder-width 37 centimeters... 
just like a girl!

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:18.920
His skin is so pale! And such soft hands!

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:20.690
I just want to eat him up!

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:23.730
You can relax and entrust yourself to them...

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:24.480
<b>Time Passed</b>

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.930
Finished!

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.900
Oh... This is just...

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:39.390
Well done! You'll make 
someone a beautiful bride!

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:40.490
What do you mean "bride"?!

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:43.450
No one could possibly guess 
that you're a boy.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.210
Are you sure?

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.890
Because if everyone on set found out,

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:51.970
I would just die of humiliation.

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:53.240
You've nothing to fear.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:57.920
Aside from us, only these 
three know your true identity.

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:55.700
He really is lovely, isn't he?

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:57.990
Yes, yes! I have complete faith in our work!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:18:00.640
<b><i>Our Trusted Staff</i></b>

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:00.640
And they'll stick close to you 
as your make-up crew.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:18:00.330
We really did a good job, huh?

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:03.600
<b>Izumi-sama</b>

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:03.600
We've given your name as 
just "Izumi" as well.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.320
You have nothing to worry about.

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:07.410
Yes?

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:10.180
Excuse me. I just wanted to introduce myself.

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:14.660
Calm down. You'll be fine.

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:18.110
We've made you up perfectly.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:23.030
Just do the best you can, and trust 
the rest to the make-up and the dress.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:26.290
Please come in.

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:30.210
Good morning!

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:33.340
I'm your co-star for today, Ichijou Ryouma!

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:35.170
<i>Ichijou Ryouma.</i>

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:36.380
Izumi-san!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:39.050
It's been so long! Have you been well?

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:41.180
Oh! These are for you.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.740
Huh? Um, thank you...

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:44.540
It's been ten whole years!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.250
I guess it has...

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:49.730
<i>Is he staring at me?</i>

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:53.030
<i>I knew it. He can tell I'm not a girl...</i>

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:55.980
I'm sorry, Ichijou-san.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:58.460
We really should have come to 
introduce ourselves to you.

00:18:58.460 --> 00:18:59.590
But you even brought flowers...

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:03.280
Oh, no. I've just really been 
looking forward to meeting again.

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:09.160
Sena Productions
Chief Manager
Sagara Rei

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:07.310
It's nice to meet you. 
I am Sagara, of Sena-Pro.

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:09.160
Yes, I've heard a lot about you.

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:12.420
Is Izumi-san represented by Sena-Pro, then?

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.430
No, she's not actually in the industry.

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:17.710
She's a relative of Nagisa's, and

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.680
filled in as a back-up during 
that shoot ten years ago.

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:21.870
Oh, I see.

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:23.450
So that's why I never saw you around.

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:25.160
Excuse me!

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:28.140
It's almost time to begin filming.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.560
Can you please stand by?

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:32.060
<i>F-Filming?!</i>

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.220
Certainly.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:35.940
I'll see you later then.

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:39.150
Yes. Thank you very much.

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:43.970
Ichijou-san is coming on set!

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:46.910
I'm Ichijou Ryouma. 
It's a pleasure to be working with all of you!

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:49.770
Rei...

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.370
Calm down.

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.700
You can mess up as many times as you need.

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:55.190
That's not it...

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:58.300
I think we're having an 
earthquake right now...

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:01.010
You're the only thing quaking here!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.250
I can't do this. I'm gonna faint.

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:06.170
You can faint as much as you 
want <i>after</i> the shoot.

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:08.220
Okay, we're ready to start!

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:11.190
Izumi-san.

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:14.060
<i>W-We're really starting...</i>

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:15.740
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:17.870
Action!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:22.300
<i>I've just gotta go for it!</i>

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.320
Cut!

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:33.550
Is the costume okay?

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:35.110
Hair and make-up refresh!

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:37.960
<i>I knew I couldn't do this.</i>

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:41.190
<i>It's just like ten years ago.</i>

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:44.780
<i>I'm going to mess up and 
ruin everything again.</i>

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:47.640
<i>Huh?</i>

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:50.380
<i>But that commercial did get finished...</i>

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:54.270
<i>But I'm sure I messed up... So, how?</i>

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:56.040
Here.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.900
Want to try using it again?

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:02.660
"Again"?

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:06.830
I don't wanna do this!

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.620
I wanna go home!

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:10.340
Darn it all.

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:12.080
What a mess...

00:21:13.270 --> 00:21:15.040
Want to borrow this?

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:17.720
What is it?

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:19.000
It's a lucky charm.

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:22.900
You hold it to your chest and say,
 "calm down, calm down,"

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.610
and all the nervousness goes away.

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:26.840
That's right!

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:29.030
It was because of your lucky charm that...

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:29.660
Yep.

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:30.760
So,

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:32.280
here.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:39.190
<i>Calm down, calm down.</i>

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:45.080
It's just like back then! 
The nerves are gone!

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:45.900
All right!

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:47.810
You did it!

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:14.270
Take two! Starting now!

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:18.550
<i>I'm not sure how, but it seems 
Ichijou Ryouma's saved the day.</i>

00:22:18.550 --> 00:22:21.610
<i>And Izumi's expression 
looks much better now.</i>

00:22:21.840 --> 00:22:23.220
<i>This may really work.</i>

00:22:23.220 --> 00:22:24.740
And the scene plays out like this.

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:26.530
Can she do it?

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:28.860
She wouldn't have taken 
the job if she couldn't.

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:30.070
Action!

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:02.070
<i>This guy's a super-popular celebrity,</i>

00:23:02.070 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>but he doesn't seem stuck up at all.</i>

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:06.150
<i>He's a really good person...</i>

00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:07.110
<i>Huh?</i>

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:16.830
The two kiss.

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:16.830
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:23:20.530 --> 00:23:21.280
Izumi-san!

00:23:21.280 --> 00:23:24.200
If I succeed, you should reward me later!

00:23:24.200 --> 00:23:25.540
Will this really work, then?

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:26.630
Onii-chan...

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:27.780
Yes! Hottie!

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:29.310
It was all thanks to Ryouma-san.

00:23:29.310 --> 00:23:32.120
Calm down, calm down.

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.280
It's because I was able to meet you...

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>This is Sena-Pro 
Management Team's Satou-san!</b>
